"Back to Momento":"返回 Momento",
"Last updated %1 November %2":"最后更新：%2 年 11 月 %1 日",
"Momento (hexarch.org) is a shared photo album for events, run by HexArch Limited. This page explains what we collect, why, where it's kept and how to have it deleted. We don't sell your information, we don't show ads, and we don't use your photos for anything except showing them to the people in your album.":"Momento（hexarch.org）是由 HexArch Limited 运营的活动共享相册。本页说明我们收集哪些信息、为什么收集、保存在哪里，以及如何删除。我们不出售你的信息，不展示广告，除了向你相册里的人展示照片外，不会将你的照片用于任何其他用途。",
"What we collect":"我们收集的信息",
"What":"内容",
"Why":"原因",
"Your name and email":"你的名字和邮箱",
"To create your account, show other album members who added each photo, and send you account emails.":"用于创建你的账户、向其他相册成员显示每张照片是谁添加的，以及向你发送账户邮件。",
"Stored only as a one-way scrambled hash; we can never see it.":"仅以单向加密的哈希值保存；我们永远无法看到它。",
"Google account details":"Google 账户信息",
"If you use “Continue with Google”: your name, email, profile picture and Google account ID, so you can sign in. We don't get your Google password or anything else in your Google account.":"如果你使用“使用 Google 继续”：我们会获取你的名字、邮箱、头像和 Google 账户 ID，以便你登录。我们不会获取你的 Google 密码或 Google 账户中的其他任何内容。",
"Photos you upload":"你上传的照片",
"To share them with the people in that album. Before storing a photo we remove its hidden details (EXIF, XMP and IPTC), including any GPS location.":"用于与该相册中的人分享。保存照片前，我们会移除其中的隐藏信息（EXIF、XMP 和 IPTC），包括任何 GPS 位置。",
"Albums you create":"你创建的相册",
"The album's name, date and times, the venue you choose on the map and its sharing zone, so guests can join and add photos at the event.":"相册的名称、日期和时间、你在地图上选择的场地及其分享范围，以便访客在活动中加入并添加照片。",
"Your location, when uploading":"上传时的位置",
"For albums with a sharing zone, your browser asks before sharing your location with us, and we use it only to check you're near the venue. We don't store it.":"对于设有分享范围的相册，你的浏览器会先征得你同意再与我们共享位置，我们只用它来确认你在场地附近，不会保存。",
"Used only while you take a photo or scan a QR code in Momento. Photos taken in Momento go straight to the album; nothing is recorded or kept otherwise.":"仅在你使用 Momento 拍照或扫描二维码时使用。在 Momento 中拍的照片会直接进入相册；除此之外不会录制或保存任何内容。",
"Login records":"登录记录",
"When you last logged in and which devices are logged in, so you can stay signed in and we can sign out old devices.":"你上次登录的时间以及哪些设备已登录，以便你保持登录，我们也能让旧设备退出。",
"Messages to support":"发给客服的消息",
"What you send through the support form, so we can reply.":"你通过客服表单发送的内容，以便我们回复。",
"Who can see your photos":"谁能看到你的照片",
