"Emails":"邮件",
"We send account emails (confirming your address, resetting your password, changing your email) and album emails a host triggers (invites and reminders). You can choose which album notifications you get in Settings. We don't send marketing emails.":"我们会发送账户邮件（确认邮箱、重置密码、更改邮箱）以及由主办人触发的相册邮件（邀请和提醒）。你可以在设置中选择接收哪些相册通知。我们不发送营销邮件。",
"How long we keep things":"我们保存多久",
"Your account and its details stay until you delete it.":"你的账户及其信息会一直保留，直到你删除账户。",
"Albums and their photos stay until the host deletes the album or their account. After an event, albums stop taking new photos but stay available to view and download.":"相册及其照片会一直保留，直到主办人删除相册或其账户。活动结束后，相册不再接收新照片，但仍可查看和下载。",
"One-time links in emails (confirm, reset) stop working after use or after they expire.":"邮件中的一次性链接（确认、重置）在使用后或过期后失效。",
"Deleting your account":"删除你的账户",
"You can delete your account in Settings. That permanently removes your account, the albums you host (with all their photos) and the photos you added to other albums. This can't be undone, so download anything you want to keep first.":"你可以在设置中删除账户。这会永久删除你的账户、你主办的相册（及其中所有照片）以及你添加到其他相册的照片。此操作无法撤销，所以请先下载想保留的内容。",
"Your choices and rights":"你的选择和权利",
"You can see and change your name and email in Settings, and download a copy of your information there (Download my data). You can also ask us for a copy of your information, a correction, or its deletion, by emailing {0}. We'll reply as soon as we can.":"你可以在设置中查看和更改名字与邮箱，也可以在那里下载你的信息副本（下载我的数据）。你还可以发邮件到 {0}，向我们索取你的信息副本、要求更正或删除。我们会尽快回复。",
"Children":"儿童",
